  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.1": "Tena samayena buddho bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Jetavane Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.2": "tena kho pana samayena bhagavatā bhikkhūnaṃ vassikasāṭikā anuññātā hoti. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.3": "chabbaggiyā bhikkhū ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.4": "bhagavatā vassikasāṭikā anuññātā 'ti appamāṇikāyo vassikasāṭikāyo dhārenti, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.5": "purato pi pacchato pi ākaḍḍhantā āhiṇḍanti. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.6": "ye te bhikkhū . . . (see ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.7": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.8": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.9": "XC.1) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.10": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.11": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.12": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.13": "uddiseyyātha: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.14.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.14.1": "vassikasāṭikaṃ pana bhikkhunā kārayamānena pamāṇikā kāretabbā. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.15": "tatr' idaṃ pamāṇaṃ: dīghaso cha vidatthiyo sugatavidatthiyā, tiriyaṃ aḍḍhateyyā. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:1.16": "taṃ atikkāmayato chedanakaṃ pācittiyan ti. ||1|| ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:2.0": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:2.1": "vassikasāṭikā nāma ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:2.2": "vassānassa cātumāsatthāya. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:2.3": "kārayamānenā 'ti . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc91:2.4": "pamāṇikā kāretabbā . . . ",
